: MIPS_R3000A-INIT ( -- )
  \ 初始化MIPS-R3000A设备
  ." 初始化MIPS-R3000A..." CR

  \ 初始化寄存器
  0 R0!  \ Hard-wired Zero
  0 R1!  \ Assembler Temporary
  0 R2!  \ Value Returned by Subroutines
  0 R3!  \ Expression Evaluation
  0 R4!  \ Expression Evaluation
  0 R5!  \ Expression Evaluation
  0 R6!  \ Expression Evaluation
  0 R7!  \ Expression Evaluation
  0 R8!  \ Expression Evaluation
  0 R9!  \ Expression Evaluation
