  0 R11!  \ Expression Evaluation
  0 R12!  \ Expression Evaluation
  0 R13!  \ Expression Evaluation
  0 R14!  \ Expression Evaluation
  0 R15!  \ Expression Evaluation
  0 R16!  \ Saved Value
  0 R17!  \ Saved Value
  0 R18!  \ Saved Value
  0 R19!  \ Saved Value
  0 R20!  \ Saved Value
  0 R21!  \ Saved Value
  0 R22!  \ Saved Value
  0 R23!  \ Saved Value
  0 R24!  \ Temporary
  0 R25!  \ Temporary
  0 R26!  \ Kernel Reserved
  0 R27!  \ Kernel Reserved
  0 R28!  \ Global Pointer
  0 R29!  \ Stack Pointer
  0 R30!  \ Frame Pointer
  0 R31!  \ Return Address
  0 HI!  \ Multiply/Divide High
  0 LO!  \ Multiply/Divide Low
  0 PC!  \ Program Counter
  0 CP0_SR!  \ Coprocessor 0 - Status Register
  0 CP0_CAUSE!  \ Coprocessor 0 - Cause Register
  0 CP0_EPC!  \ Coprocessor 0 - Exception PC
  0 CP0_BADVADDR!  \ Coprocessor 0 - Bad Virtual Address
  0 CP0_CONTEXT!  \ Coprocessor 0 - Context Register
  0 CP0_PID!  \ Coprocessor 0 - Process ID

  \ 初始化外设
